---
/**
 * The idea behind the studio, stated plainly. Leads with the outcome
 * (attention, presence with gravity); the tooling never opens.
 */
---

<section class="a-section a-manifesto">
  <p class="a-label" data-a-fade>01 · The idea</p>

  <h2 class="a-statement a-display" data-a-lines>
    <span class="a-mask"><span class="a-mask-inner">Attention is the</span></span>
    <span class="a-mask"><span class="a-mask-inner">rarest territory.</span></span>
  </h2>

  <div class="a-manifesto-cols">
    <p data-a-fade>
      Every market is mapped and every feed is full. What is left to win is
      attention, and attention goes to the teams whose work feels inevitable.
    </p>
    <p data-a-fade>
      That is the work we do: presence with gravity. Fast, considered, and
      built to hold up long after launch day.
    </p>
  </div>

  <span class="a-rule" data-a-rule aria-hidden="true"></span>
</section>

<style>
  .a-manifesto-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    max-width: 980px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 8vh, 5rem);
  }
  .a-manifesto-cols p {
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.4vw, 1.12rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--a-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .a-manifesto-cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
